Package: agentomicsCore
Type: Package
Title: Framework for LLM-Orchestrated, Audited Bioinformatics Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Changhao", family = "Kan",
                  email = "kch_ynu@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generic R-side infrastructure for building agent-friendly,
    fully auditable bioinformatics pipelines. Provides an S4 container
    (AgentOmics) that accumulates a decision log and an executable R
    script alongside whatever data payload it holds (Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment, GRanges, &c.). Ships a multi-provider LLM
    chat function factory (Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Grok, Qwen,
    Kimi, Ollama, OpenAI-compatible) with per-call token usage
    tracking, an HTML report renderer with a section-extension hook,
    and checkpoint I/O. Designed as the foundation for downstream
    domain packages such as scAgentKit (single-cell RNA-seq),
    atacAgentKit, chipAgentKit, spatialAgentKit, and others.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
